{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12020,"id":"2381521fee7cee7e"}||{"x":40,"y":350,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":true,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"设计说明（参数为计算值，未实测；依据见 docs/design.md）","fillColor":null,"zIndex":401,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12021,"id":"44fbbedd2851052f"}||{"x":40,"y":325,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"1. 串在电管 Chassis 口与超电功率板 CN8 之间，限制 Chassis 口打开时给下游电容充电的浪涌。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":402,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12022,"id":"7c1452e4c3450ceb"}||{"x":40,"y":303,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"2. R1 = 2 mΩ：限流 24–31 A，断路器 40–65 A（VCL 48.5–61.5 mV，VCB 80–130 mV）。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":403,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12023,"id":"551f2a00c94e29f1"}||{"x":40,"y":281,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"3. R3 = 14.3 kΩ：功率限制约 70 W（VDS = 25.5 V，按手册偏差约 53–87 W）。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":404,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12024,"id":"a8a346c26172a993"}||{"x":40,"y":259,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"4. C3 = 100 nF：启动斜率约 0.16 V/ms（0.10–0.22 V/ms），下游 2 mF 时浪涌约 0.3 A。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":405,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12025,"id":"5c97b11cb2943866"}||{"x":40,"y":237,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"5. C2 = 100 nF：插入延时约 73 ms，故障时间约 4.7 ms，故障后约 0.94 s 自动重试。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":406,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12026,"id":"0c1bbc3b25882c72"}||{"x":40,"y":215,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"6. R2 = 100 kΩ 把 UVLO 上拉到 VIN（手册方案 C），VIN 约 8.4 V 时接通；OVLO 接地禁用。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":407,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12027,"id":"100fa5da0d7fb304"}||{"x":40,"y":193,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"7. 斜坡结束、PGD 变高前，下游不应取电。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":408,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":12028,"id":"2b772e4e09661da7"}||{"x":40,"y":171,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":null,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"LEFT_BOTTOM","value":"8. LED1 绿：输出有电；LED2 红：PGD 未就绪或故障。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":409,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
